graph TD
    START([Payment Created]) --> PENDING[PENDING State]

    PENDING -->|User Initiates| PROCESSING[PROCESSING State]
    PENDING -->|Timeout| EXPIRED[EXPIRED State]
    PENDING -->|Validation Fails| FAILED[FAILED State]

    PROCESSING -->|Provider Confirms| COMPLETED[COMPLETED State]
    PROCESSING -->|Provider Rejects| FAILED

    COMPLETED -->|Refund Request| REFUNDED[REFUNDED State]

    FAILED -->|Retry Attempt| PENDING

    EXPIRED --> TERMINAL_E([Terminal])
    REFUNDED --> TERMINAL_R([Terminal])

    %% Validation Annotations
    PENDING -.->|Atomic Check| DB1[(Database)]
    PROCESSING -.->|Atomic Check| DB2[(Database)]
    COMPLETED -.->|Atomic Check| DB3[(Database)]
    FAILED -.->|Atomic Check| DB4[(Database)]

    %% Event Logging
    PENDING -.->|Event Created| EVENTS1[(Payment Events)]
    PROCESSING -.->|Event Created| EVENTS2[(Payment Events)]
    COMPLETED -.->|Event Created| EVENTS3[(Payment Events)]
    FAILED -.->|Event Created| EVENTS4[(Payment Events)]
    EXPIRED -.->|Event Created| EVENTS5[(Payment Events)]
    REFUNDED -.->|Event Created| EVENTS6[(Payment Events)]

    style PENDING fill:#fff3cd
    style PROCESSING fill:#cfe2ff
    style COMPLETED fill:#d1e7dd
    style FAILED fill:#f8d7da
    style EXPIRED fill:#dee2e6
    style REFUNDED fill:#dee2e6
    style DB1 fill:#e7f3ff
    style DB2 fill:#e7f3ff
    style DB3 fill:#e7f3ff
    style DB4 fill:#e7f3ff
    style EVENTS1 fill:#e7f3ff
    style EVENTS2 fill:#e7f3ff
    style EVENTS3 fill:#e7f3ff
    style EVENTS4 fill:#e7f3ff
    style EVENTS5 fill:#e7f3ff
    style EVENTS6 fill:#e7f3ff
